00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:53.350
Um so we're going to start with the very

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:55.990
basics of uh what's a binary variable of

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.470
any variable. X in this case has two

00:00:58.480 --> 00:01:00.310
states either represented either by a

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:03.349
