00:01:03.359 --> 00:01:05.350
operators. They are the not function

00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:08.310
written algebraically as Z equals over

00:01:08.320 --> 00:01:11.429
bar X. And that basically inverts it. So

00:01:11.439 --> 00:01:15.270
uh if x is zero, zed is one and if x is

00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:17.910
one, zed is zero. For the not function,

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:19.990
the and function is a function of two

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:23.030
