00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:46.389
are true.

00:01:46.399 --> 00:01:48.230
If neither are true then it's zero. So

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:49.990
those are the basic operators that we

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.270
need for Boolean algebra

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:55.429
and we can represent these in in several

00:01:55.439 --> 00:01:57.590
different ways. So for these three basic

