00:05:57.600 --> 00:06:00.310
not x and not y. So these are quite

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:02.390
important identities because they allow

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:05.990
you to convert between or um nor

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:08.790
functions and NAND functions essentially.

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:10.230
Um you can check the

